"From the chip's energy counters (the same source as powermetrics), averaged over each tick. Neural Engine power is the signal that a Core ML model is running: it reads zero when the ANE is idle." = "From the chip's energy counters (the same source as powermetrics), averaged over each tick. Neural Engine power is the signal that a Core ML model is running: it reads zero when the ANE is idle.";
